/dim]sase-j9[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-j9/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add the `-` panel fold sweep with a per-panel reverse[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sweep[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sweep: add a configurable `collapse_panel_folds` action bound to `-` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that saturates every open lane, clan, and top-level grouping banner in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the focused tribe panel in one press, remembers exactly what it closed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in a session-local per-panel record, and re-expands that record when the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel has nothing left to collapse. Works from whole-panel focus, from a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]row selection, and in merged layout. Resync the footer, command palette,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]help modal, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Give `H` a hinted fold collapse on a selected tribe panel[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]hint[dim] · [dim][/dim]after sweep[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]hint: replace the whole-panel `H` collapse ladder with a collapse-intent[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold hint mode — the `L` hint affordance restricted to folds that are [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]currently expanded, collapsing the picked fold instead of toggling it. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Retire the now-dead panel-ladder resolvers, and resync the footer, help [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]modal, keymap labels, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-j9","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-j9.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a